---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-pdw-dark">
    <img
      src="/images/stock/desert-range.jpg"
      alt="Range in the Utah desert"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-40"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pdw-dark via-pdw-dark/80 to-pdw-dark/50"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10">
      <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pdw-tan">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 max-w-3xl font-display text-3xl font-bold uppercase leading-tight text-pdw-white sm:text-4xl">
        Built by a shooter, for shooters
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pdw-tan-dark">How It Started</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-pdw-ink">A Problem Nobody Else Was Solving</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-pdw-body">
          Peak Defense Works started with a simple problem: nobody was building serious chassis systems for the
          Taurus TX22. Sam set out to change that, designing the TX22 Mountain Chassis from the ground up as the
          first MP7-style build to hit the market for the platform. Since launch, thousands have shipped to
          shooters who wanted more control, more stability, and more fun out of a pistol most people
          underestimated.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-8 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pdw-tan-dark">Our Mission</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-pdw-ink">Sweet Builds, Real-World Prices</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-pdw-body">
          That first build set the mission for everything after it: PDW exists to make sweet firearm builds more
          attainable for regular Americans. You want something unique, functional, and attention-grabbing
          without paying outrageous prices? We got you.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative h-80 overflow-hidden lg:h-[30rem]">
        <img src="/images/about/sam-portrait.jpg" alt="Sam, founder of Peak Defense Works" class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[50%_20%]" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid items-stretch gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="relative order-last h-80 overflow-hidden lg:order-first lg:h-0 lg:min-h-full">
        <img src="/images/about/sam-portrait-2.jpg" alt="Sam running a live-fire demo of a PDW build" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pdw-tan-dark">How It's Built</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-pdw-ink">Designed and Printed in Central Utah</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-pdw-body">
          Every product is designed and manufactured right here in Central Utah, on a print floor Sam runs
          himself, giving us complete control over form, fit, and finish from the initial idea all the way to a
          product in your hands. Instead of outsourcing ideas or chasing trends, we focus on creating parts and
          components that are clean, functional, durable, and built for real-world use. Nothing ships until it
          has been run under real recoil, not just tested on a bench.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-8 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pdw-tan-dark">Owner-Operated</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-pdw-ink">No Investors, No Shortcuts</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-pdw-body">
          The company is fully owner-operated. Sam owns the product and the intellectual property outright,
          having walked away from an earlier partnership that wanted a three-way profit split and shared IP
          rights. We put a huge emphasis on smart design and modern, efficient additive manufacturing to keep
          pricing as low as possible without cutting corners. Whether you're building your first setup or
          upgrading a platform you already love, PDW products are made to give you unique styling, solid
          performance, and prices that keep you coming back, all dedicated to the average American shooter.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/shop"
          class="mt-6 inline-block border border-pdw-tan bg-pdw-tan px-6 py-3 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-pdw-ink transition-colors hover:bg-pdw-tan-dark"
        >
          Shop Now
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 border-t border-pdw-border pt-12 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-3xl text-pdw-tan-dark">1st</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-pdw-body">MP7-style chassis for the TX22 to hit the market</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-3xl text-pdw-tan-dark">1000s</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-pdw-body">Chassis systems shipped since launch</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-3xl text-pdw-tan-dark">100%</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-pdw-body">Designed and 3D printed in Utah</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-pdw-border bg-pdw-offwhite">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 text-center lg:px-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-pdw-ink">Want to see it in person?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-pdw-body">
        Reach out with questions about fit, availability, or upcoming drops.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="mt-6 inline-block border border-pdw-tan bg-pdw-tan px-6 py-3 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-pdw-ink transition-colors hover:bg-pdw-tan-dark"
      >
        Contact Us
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
